// StudioCore wraps the studio tool — Studio: assets, generation and publishing. Main Studio entry point for visual creation on your own account: character/scene/prop assets, the output and reference library, generation jobs, and actual image and video rendering. Pick an operation with `action`. Video always goes through storyboard first (`storyboard_plan` -> `draw_storyboard` -> user approval -> `storyboard_video`); `generate_video` is disabled. Async results differ by action: `generate_image` / `storyboard_video` return `outputs[]` with signed download links or a `pending` result to poll via `studio_outputs`; `process_asset` / `edit_asset` are polled with `get_asset`; narration and montage actions finish synchronously. It also covers motion-graphic drafts, motion template library, Director productions, audio/video plan, folders, social posting and SEO blog actions.
type StudioCore struct{ c *Client }

